00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,690
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) James woke up.

2
00:00:02,390 --> 00:00:04,150
He had to get ready for school.

3
00:00:05,130 --> 00:00:06,410
He looked in the mirror.

4
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:10,350
There was a big, red bump on his

5
00:00:10,350 --> 00:00:10,730
forehead.

6
00:00:11,590 --> 00:00:12,850
It was a pimple.

7
00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:14,930
He was worried.

8
00:00:15,370 --> 00:00:17,090
He wanted it to be gone.

9
00:00:17,850 --> 00:00:19,370
He washed his face.

10
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:22,150
The pimple was still there.

11
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:25,430
He popped the pimple with his fingers.

12
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:27,950
It was still there.

13
00:00:28,410 --> 00:00:30,450
It looked even worse.

14
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:32,870
It was very red.

15
00:00:33,770 --> 00:00:35,190
He tried covering it.

16
00:00:35,930 --> 00:00:37,890
He asked his sister for makeup.

17
00:00:38,950 --> 00:00:40,590
She laughed at him.

18
00:00:41,550 --> 00:00:43,050
Forget it, he thought.

19
00:00:43,990 --> 00:00:46,150
Later, he went on his computer.

20
00:00:46,990 --> 00:00:48,730
He looked up ways to get rid of

21
00:00:48,730 --> 00:00:48,910
it.

22
00:00:49,550 --> 00:00:51,370
There was no instant way.

23
00:00:52,090 --> 00:00:53,830
He just had to be patient.
